    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/b07a0075944ed3da2081cceae4bac7df.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/3132dfeb69a77af1d399cd7ec46e5515.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You weren\u2019t always the most feared criminal in Shadow City. Experience the gritty tale of how you clawed your way to power. Forge alliances or crush your rivals, where every choice determines who survives, who falls, and who remains by your side in Shadow City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/ae42fa9a1e5dbdbebe36c8b5d8e862bd.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate with Shadow City\u2019s elite: bribe, threaten, or charm them into following your lead. Every relationship matters, and every favor comes with a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/71fcd3d965d201b60f7566e7ca4dccde.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, whether in loyalty or betrayal, shapes your rise to power. Choose how you seize control: through fear, cunning deals, or something more brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/c4a40a0017e388fdb92ea703cbe1c880.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mistake can topple even the mightiest king. From personal vendettas to citywide fallout, your choices echo far beyond the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/173ba264168a375436fe5ce5bea8fc1b.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions set the stage for each chapter and ultimately influence the events of <i><strong>Shadow City Mysteries: A Clockwork Noir</strong></i>. The fate of Shadow City rests in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/b07a0075944ed3da2081cceae4bac7df.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/3132dfeb69a77af1d399cd7ec46e5515.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You weren\u2019t always the most feared criminal in Shadow City. Experience the gritty tale of how you clawed your way to power. Forge alliances or crush your rivals, where every choice determines who survives, who falls, and who remains by your side in Shadow City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/ae42fa9a1e5dbdbebe36c8b5d8e862bd.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate with Shadow City\u2019s elite: bribe, threaten, or charm them into following your lead. Every relationship matters, and every favor comes with a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/71fcd3d965d201b60f7566e7ca4dccde.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, whether in loyalty or betrayal, shapes your rise to power. Choose how you seize control: through fear, cunning deals, or something more brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/c4a40a0017e388fdb92ea703cbe1c880.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mistake can topple even the mightiest king. From personal vendettas to citywide fallout, your choices echo far beyond the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496430/extras/173ba264168a375436fe5ce5bea8fc1b.avif?t=1755155272\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions set the stage for each chapter and ultimately influence the events of <i><strong>Shadow City Mysteries: A Clockwork Noir</strong></i>. The fate of Shadow City rests in your hands.</p>",
    "short_description": "Shadow City Mysteries: Case Files \u2013 Rise of the Rat King is a narrative game set in Shadow City\u2019s underbelly. Assume the role of the Rat King, an underworld mastermind fighting for absolute power. Shape your legend by forging alliances, crushing rivals, and leaving a trail of consequences.",
